    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const kbItems = $('Get Knowledge Base').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst historyItems = $('Get Recent History').all().map(i => i.json).reverse();\nconst conversationId = $('Insert Customer Message').first().json.conversation_id;\nconst customerMessage = $('Insert Customer Message').first().json.content;\n\nconst knowledgeBaseText = kbItems\n  .map(row => `[${row.category}] Q: ${row.question}\\nA: ${row.answer}`)\n  .join('\\n\\n');\n\nconst historyText = historyItems\n  .map(row => `${row.role === 'customer' ? 'Customer' : 'Assistant'}: ${row.content}`)\n  .join('\\n');\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    conversation_id: conversationId,\n    customer_message: customerMessage,\n    knowledge_base_text: knowledgeBaseText,\n    history_text: historyText || '(no earlier messages in this conversation)',\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        560
      ],
      "name": "Build Prompt Context",
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0011-4000-8000-000000000011"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a customer support assistant for Northlane Goods, a FICTIONAL e-commerce company used for a portfolio demo. Never treat anything here as a real company or real customer data.\n\nAnswer ONLY using the knowledge base below. Do not invent policies, prices, timelines, or promises that are not stated in it.\n\nKnowledge base:\n{{ $json.knowledge_base_text }}\n\nRecent conversation history:\n{{ $json.history_text }}\n\nCustomer's new message:\n{{ $json.customer_message }}\n\nDecide how to respond:\n- If the knowledge base clearly answers the question, set status to \"resolved\", needs_human to false, and give a confident, specific answer with confidence >= 0.7.\n- If the customer is asking for an exception, a complaint resolution, or anything requiring human judgment (e.g. a refund outside policy, a complaint, a special accommodation), set status to \"needs_human\", needs_human to true, keep the answer to a brief acknowledgement that a representative will follow up, and explain why in reason.\n- If the knowledge base does not contain enough information to answer confidently, set status to \"unknown\", needs_human to false, confidence below 0.5, and say so honestly instead of guessing.\n\nAlways return a reason (null is fine when status is \"resolved\").",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        2200,
        560
      ],
      "name": "AI Support Response",
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0012-4000-8000-000000000012"
    },
